sequenceDiagram
 participant A as Application
 participant K as Kernel I/O
 participant R as Device driver
 participant D as Controller and device
 A->>K: read() or write()
 K->>K: Validate, buffer, cache or queue
 K->>R: Issue device-specific request
 R->>D: Program transfer
 D-->>R: Interrupt on completion
 R-->>K: Report result
 K-->>A: Return or notify completion
